From: Proton CRM <noreply@proton.local>
Subject: [PATCH] PII masking follows PII_MASKING_ENABLED; 5 s request timeout
 (final review I3, ruling R26)

Patch 0085 masked on every tenant while /authz/me/pii was pending or
failing, including tenants with masking switched off. The Rails layout now
emits window.__PROTON_PII_MASKING__ from env PII_MASKING_ENABLED (same
mechanism as patch 0079's idle timeout; docker-compose.tenant.yml forwards
the variable to chatwoot-rails). Flag absent/false: never call
/authz/me/pii, never mask. Flag true: 0085's behaviour unchanged (masked
while pending, fail closed except 404), plus a 5 s AbortController timeout
on the request (adminRequest gains an optional `signal`).

---
